at he now works for an even more powerful demon lord, comes to kill Avan. To save his students, Avan uses a Self-Sacrifice spell to attack, but is unable to defeat Hadlar. When it seems that Dai and Avan's other student Pop are doomed, a mark appears on Dai's forehead and he suddenly gains super powers and is able to fend off Hadlar. The two students then go off on a journey to avenge Avan and bring peace back to the world.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Swordplay","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dungeon","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Spearplay","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":34,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":28,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Creature Taming","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":10,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gore","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Dragon Quest: The Adventure of Dai","english":"Dragon Quest: The Adventure of Dai","native":"ドラゴンクエスト ダイの大冒険","romaji":"Dragon Quest: Dai no Daibouken (2020)","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"勇者斗恶龙 达伊的大冒险"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"DRAGON QUEST ダイの大冒険"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"神龙之谜 达尔大冒险"}]},"trailer":{"id":"RrwbuwhIwbA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RrwbuwhIwbA/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}